      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 26A(1) of the principal Act is amended"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the full stop at the end of that sub- section a colon and by inserting thereafter the following proviso: \"Provided that a company which is already operating in Malaysia may, if it fulfills such conditions as may be determined by the Minister, make an application in writing to the Minister for approval for purposes of an investment tax allowance.\"."
